<title>GREECE: Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</title>
<headline>Table of Greek mutual fund flows, assets.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices.</p>
<p>					Sept 30/Sept 27 Sept 30/Dec 31, 95</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.06		 9.67</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.10		10.37</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.20		 4.50</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			   -0.76		 2.09</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.43		25.92</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.50		29.90</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.35	     -20.41</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -0.52		-4.71</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.52		36.85</p>
<p>  Fixed income mutual funds	   0.61		41.84</p>
<p>  International funds		  -0.16	     -18.24</p>
<p>  Growth funds			   -1.27		-4.06</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31, 1991.</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
